        "@id": "https://metahumotonic.com/foundation/#initiative"
      },
      "schema:text": "The pinned public sources describe PUBLIC_OPEN_SOURCE_INITIATIVE and NOT_YET_LEGALLY_INCORPORATED. This handoff records the source claim, not an independent legal-registry verification or safety certification.",
